      "role": "user",
      "content": "the care team doesn't get it. they just see the patient. they don't see me. and honestly, even if i slept for a week, everything would still be exactly the same. i'm just so tired of fighting for a life that feels like it's already over. sometimes i just sit here watching him sleep and think about how much easier it would be if everything would just... stop. if i didn't have to wake up and face this reality again.",
